<title>USA: Negotiated muni bond sales total $870 mln Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Negotiated muni bond sales total $870 mln Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled negotiated municipal bond sales are expected to total $870 million in 15 offerings on Tuesday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $270 million Denver City &amp; County Airport revenue bond offering through Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p>An additional $28 million of deals are on the possible list for Tuesday, indicating underwriters have said they may price the issues depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>-----------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
